{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtJZhefLaah7CQu84Qo5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The ablated pass ran, but text B came back 43 tokens shorter (1,785 vs 1,828), so I evidently dropped a few repeated lines when re-pasting it. Text A is identical (1,873 tokens). The whole-text mean log-prob fell from −0.31 to −0.39 (A) and from −0.18 to −0.37 (B). I'll compare token by token. For A, that's a direct position-wise comparison. For B, I'll use the identical prefix, which covers the pre-loop part and the start of the loop. I'll split the effect into pre-loop tokens, loop tokens, and loop line-start tokens. If loop tokens lose much more log-prob than pre-loop tokens, these heads are causal drivers of the copy.\n\n```python\n# Hypothesis: ablating 4 induction heads lowers loop-token logprob much more than pre-loop-token logprob.\nids6 = np.load('/work/fwd_6/input_ids.npy'); tlp6 = np.load('/work/fwd_6/token_logprobs.npy')\ndef compare(b, tlp_new, ids_new, label):\n    L0 = lens5[b]; a = ids5[b, :L0]; n = ids_new[b, :L0]\n    m = min(L0, len(n)); same = np.where(a[:m] != n[:m])[0]; common = same[0] if len(same) else m\n    on = loop_start_tok[b]\n    o = tlp[b, :common-1]; e = tlp_new[b, :common-1]   # logprob of token t+1 given prefix up to t\n    pos = np.arange(1, common)                          # index of predicted token\n    pre = (pos > 150) & (pos < on); lp = pos >= on + 64\n    nl = np.array([('\\n' in tok.decode([int(a[p-1])])) for p in pos])   # predicted token follows a newline (line start)\n    print(f'{label} text{b}: common={common} onset={on}')\n    for nm, msk in [('pre-loop', pre), ('loop', lp), ('loop line-start', lp & nl), ('pre line-start', pre & nl)]:\n        if msk.sum() == 0: continue\n        print(f'   {nm:16s} n={msk.sum():4d}  orig={o[msk].mean():7.3f}  edit={e[msk].mean():7.3f}  diff={(e[msk]-o[msk]).mean():7.3f}  p_orig={np.exp(o[msk]).mean():.3f} p_edit={np.exp(e[msk]).mean():.3f}')\nfor b in range(2): compare(b, tlp6, ids6, 'ablate IND4')\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6116,"cache_read_input_tokens":91591,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6116},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"37ae3ac5-393a-4da3-8caf-f8ba0ea8f929","uuid":"dac46276-9ed4-4fae-a5a0-30e9dd7f08e3","timestamp":"2026-11-10T00:30:42.728Z","request_id":"req_011CgtJZggNF6kft8uxVrDYe"}
